            "1 Hiw o, tingkauh kaeng guay aseic neihlaa e,",
            "Bumaengh khat maeng tatmei guang dat the;",
            "Zauc lo, Pu }?2 kata chaeng khou pat riu e,",
            "Hanc guang datmei nac ta laalou khang.",
            "",
            "Hym daic diu! baanch’ra nunc }?2 suan e,",
            "Hym daic diu! nrah downa suan e,",
            "Thuakloumei kangdai 2}? duipui khwan kumcna",
            "Duakpatmei lu kaucna suan bam e.",
            "",
            "2 Hiw o, tingkauh kaeng guay, aseic neihlaa e,",
            "’Maanmei nac ta zay kariulou the;",
            "Bumaengh khat paapc khou }?2 asut guang dat the;",
            "Puancthanhna thuakloumei nac sw the.",
            "",
            "3 Hiw o, tingkauh kaeng guay, khwmkih khou guang tho,",
            "Baanch’ra nunc neihlaa lu kauc bam the,",
            "Neihlaa chamv dinc lik tio, sangdiuh thangc nganvna!",
            "Kunghmei bumaengc khat",
            "puancthanh dat the."
